**Technical Assumptions:**
- Desktop/laptop user (no mobile support required)
- Minimum screen resolution: 1280 × 800
- Modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- Most likely scenario is to run web interface on laptop, where the user will have their audio files, while pipeline executes on remote server

