## Feature Requirements

### 1. Pipeline Execution Features

| Feature | Description | Priority |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **Job Configuration** | Upload audio files, select pipeline mode (most likely  to be  VAD-split-audio), configure options | High |
| **Pipeline Monitoring** | Real-time progress of each pipeline stage | High |
| **Job Queue Management** | View pending/running/completed jobs | Medium |
| **Configuration Presets** | Save and reuse common configurations | Low |
| **Batch Processing** | Queue multiple interview pairs for processing | Medium |

### 2. Transcript Viewing Features

| Feature | Description | Priority |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **Stage-by-Stage View** | View output from each pipeline stage independently | High |
| **Audio Playback** | Play audio with standard controls (play/pause/seek/speed) | High |
| **Block-Level Highlighting if in VAD-split-audio mode** | Highlight current block as audio plays based on block starting timestamp | High |
| **Word-Level Highlighting if not in VAD-split-audio mode** | Highlight current word as audio plays if words have timestamps | High |
| **Speaker/Block Color Coding** | Visual distinction between speakers | High |
| **Timestamp Display** | Show timestamps for each turn/segment | High |
| **Jump to Position** | Click any word/block to jump audio to that position | High |
| **Dual Audio Sync** | Option to play both speaker tracks in sync | Medium |
| **Waveform Visualization** | Visual audio waveform for navigation | Medium |

### 3. Transcript Editing Features

| Feature | Description | Priority |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **Click-to-Edit Word** | Click any word to correct it | High |
| **Insert Word** | Click between words to insert new word(s) | High |
| **Delete Word** | Remove incorrect words | High |
| **Merge Words** | Combine split words (e.g., "to" "gether" → "together") | High |
| **Split Words** | Separate joined words | Medium |
| **Change Speaker** | Reassign a turn to different speaker | High |
| **Adjust Turn Boundaries** | Move where one speaker's turn ends and another begins | Medium |
| **Add/Edit Annotations** | Add notes like [laughter], [pause], [inaudible] | High |
| **Bulk Find & Replace** | Replace all instances of a word/phrase | Medium |
| **Undo/Redo** | Full edit history with unlimited undo | High |
| **Auto-Save** | Automatic saving of edits with versioning | High |

### 4. De-identification Editing Features

| Feature | Description | Priority |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **PII Highlight Mode** | Toggle to highlight all detected PII | High |
| **Manual Redaction** | Select text to mark as PII for redaction | High |
| **Redaction Override** | Unmark incorrectly flagged PII | High |
| **PII Audit Trail** | View what was redacted and why | High |
| **Second-Pass Review** | Dedicated review mode for de-identification QA | High |

### 5. Export & Output Features

| Feature | Description | Priority |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **Export Formats** | Download as TXT, JSON, Video | High |
| **Export Stages** | Export from any pipeline stage | High |
| **Comparison View** | Side-by-side before/after, raw transcript, de-identification, and after LLM cleanup | High |
| **Print-Friendly View** | Formatted view for printing | High |

